{"id": "De2onusyJ5G", "title": "Video by github_dev", "description": "Meta N: The AI That Codes Its Own Upgrades\n\nhttps://github.com/minnesotanlp/meta-n\n\nMeta N is the research framework that makes AI agents upgrade their own code. Most systems just tweak final answers, but this project digs deeper. It uses a universal engine to read execution logs and write new helper functions directly into the agent's stack. Think of it as an AI that looks at its own mistakes and patches its own brain. This is not just theory; it is a working prototype that tests itself across nine major benchmarks, from legal reasoning to terminal commands. The result is a stack of self-improving layers that get better with every run. The takeaway?\n\n#Meta #N #The #AI #That #Codes #Its #Own #Upgrades #MetaNTheAIThatCodesItsOwnUpgrades #DeveloperTools #Search", "channel": "github_dev", "uploader_id": "78389735637", "uploader": "Github repo", "timestamp": 1792794607, "like_count": 744, "comment_count": 3, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-29133527583004963a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 29.04, "asr": 24000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMgZBE46Y0NSkbyrm753i5MBDbWXlFuQ3PWiXYlzXELswW-2Judrr-XhsqHksYSdcCgrrne4Fa2faDizr9kCd0EHNU1u-ORaVkt9hI.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=HdIgdx2A-9IQ7kNvwH0x_aq&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=8QVW_Sl_Pvr0xekTv9W22A&_nc_ss=79689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQROMwGCxmVC